  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Media control claims",
  "description": "The image of a Black man with a menacing expression is often used to imply that Black people are inferior or animal-like, which is a common racist trope used to justify discrimination and reinforce racial hierarchies. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding why the visual is used to imply criminality and menace.",
